  "Meet the frightful lizard, Daspletosaurus!",
  "This tyrannosaurid lived in Laramidia between 77 and 74.4 million years ago.",
  "An average adult measured 8.5 to 9 meters long.",
  "It weighed up to 3 metric tons as a bipedal predator.",
  "Its fossils have been found in Alberta and Montana.",
  "This creature is closely related to Tyrannosaurus.",
  "Multiple unnamed specimens may even represent new species."
